    checkbox (for paragraph) which indicates to parse the request or not?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16019203" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 22 May 2017 07:00:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user prabhjyotsingh commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2347&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2347&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

